1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,860
Web pages open in tabs, right beside your terminals.

2
00:00:05,024 --> 00:00:09,604
Press Command Shift B for a browser tab, and type an address.

3
00:00:10,645 --> 00:00:16,025
It's a real browser: preview what your agent is building without leaving Sheprd.

4
00:00:16,025 --> 00:00:20,845
Annotate lets you point at anything on the page and describe the change you want.

5
00:00:21,728 --> 00:00:25,268
Your notes go straight to the agent that opened the page.
